+The first network-available attempt publishes `connecting` before starting its source. Subsequent attempts, including explicit reconnect and recovery from browser offline, publish `reconnecting`. Only the event ready frame publishes `ready`; browser network suspension publishes `offline`. The observable is undefined only before loop ownership starts and after it stops. A state listener may stop or replace the initial attempt before it acquires a source.
