+Preset preferences additionally require `settings.write.v1`. Without it, the picker-policy switch and default choices are disabled with a localized explanation; retained callbacks skip both Settings writes and blank-Session synchronization. Directory queries and location actions require `settings.agent-preset-directory.v1`, independently of preset catalog or management. Copying remains available when supported and does not probe or open an unsupported directory API afterward. Restored capabilities update the existing renderer hooks; provider refusals remain visible failures.
